@baseUrl = http://localhost:5120

### Criar entidade
# @name createPartner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Nova Empresa",
	"taxNumber": "987.654.321",
	"type": "BOTH",
	"email": "contacto@example.test",
	"creditLimit": 2500.00
}

### Obter entidade criada
@partnerId = {{createPartner.response.body.$.id}}
@version = {{createPartner.response.body.$.version}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar entidades por nome ou NIF
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?Search=Empresa&IncludeInactive=false&Page=1&PageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar entidade
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Nova Empresa Atualizada",
	"taxNumber": "987 654 321",
	"type": "BOTH",
	"email": null,
	"creditLimit": 3000.00,
	"isActive": true,
	"version": "{{version}}"
}

### GET de Id inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
